      en: 'On the model: gold with red gems (to be confirmed)'
    philosophy:
      id: '[Draf] Diisi kurator setelah spesimen asli ditetapkan.'
      en: '[Draft] To be written by the curator once the real specimen is chosen.'
    craft:
      id: Cincin logam di antara hulu dan ganja. Pada lembar acuan dihiasi deretan
        permata merah dan butiran emas.
      en: A metal ring between the hilt and the ganja. On the reference sheet it
        is set with a row of red gems and gold beads.
